message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "AncientEgyptianFuneraryMonuments: Semantic model and Linked Open Data for Late Period rock-cut funerary monuments at Thebes"
abstract: >-
  Ontology modules, controlled vocabularies, shape-grammar data and slide figures
  for the comparative analysis of Ancient Egyptian Late Period funerary monuments
  (Twenty-fifth and Twenty-sixth Dynasty, Thebes). Companion to the CHNT31 contribution
  "From Single Monuments to Systematic Comparison".
